        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-475 (ensure controlled execution — MSME/Sari-Sari Account Acquisition &amp; Micro-Distribution (PA-82.1).) | - operational: segment-level sell-through analysis
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
